{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/19/0909563/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Hello"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/19/0909563/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/19/0909563/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつもコメントくださるかた"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/19/0909563/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初めてのかた"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/19/0909563/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"久しぶりのかた"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/19/0909563/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほんとーにほんとーに有り難うございます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/19/0909563/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも、\n一つ一つ心に刻みながらありがたく読ませていただいてます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/19/0909563/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも皆様がくれる言葉は暖かくて......大好きです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/19/0909563/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日常にあったことを、\nツイッター感覚でコメントくださるかたもいて！\nその人の色々なことも知れるし、\nとってもうれしーです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/19/0909563/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/19/0909563/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、\n昨日の\nレッスン中、\n『走れbicycle』\nのフリを覚えるため、選抜メンバーが踊ってるのを動画で撮ってたら、\n『べー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/19/0909563/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"』\nって誰かがカメラにむかってやったり、変な顔をしたりしてきました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/19/0909563/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"んもーっだれー？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/19/0909563/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そうです！\nおちゃめなおちゃめなおちゃめちゃん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その名はー？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/19/0909563/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"れなりん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/19/0909563/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もーやっぱり！れなりんなのねー！えへへっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/19/0909563/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"嘘！好きじゃなくて大好き"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/19/0909563/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/19/0909563/0011.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほんで、今日は........."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/19/0909563/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(トマトちゃん)とお買い物にいってきたよー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/19/0909563/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私はスッピンで、トマトちゃんと写真を撮ったので、\n多分貼ってないと思うけど、トマトblogにまぁやの写メがあったら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(あっ！(;゜∇゜)？？？スッピンなんだなー(T_T))"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"っと想ってください"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/19/0909563/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"トマトちゃんとは、一緒にお食事して、ショッピングモールをぐるぐるぐるぐる......ぐるぐるカーテンしました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/19/0909563/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"※華麗にスルーしてください！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"食料品などかったよー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/19/0909563/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(←完全に主婦ですね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/19/0909563/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":")"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"トマトちゃんの口癖が発覚したよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/19/0909563/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『それなー！』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って何回もゆうの"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/19/0909563/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(あっ！また言ってるー！)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"っと思いながら聞いてましたよ！\n(大人のまあやだっぺっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/19/0909563/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":")"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めっちゃあっという間に時間が過ぎていったねー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/19/0909563/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/19/0909563/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/19/0909563/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/19/0909563/0015.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この草の隣にあるバスケットボールは、くもちゃん(みくもちゃん)が、とまりにきたときに忘れて帰ったまま、ずっとおいてあります"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/19/0909563/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、今ひめたんとメールしたの！\n二人ともたまたまご当地アイドルのTV をみてて、まずは、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『広島県民全員が乃木坂46！\n和田まあやと中元ひめかを知ってもらおう！』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って夢をたてたよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/19/0909563/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、まぁ日本全国！そして、世界の数々の人々が知っている☆AKB 48☆さんみたいになりたいけど！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まずは、目の前にあることからコツコツとがんばろーかなぁ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/19/0909563/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"っと思いまして......。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"努力は必ず報われると！いったけど！\n全てがむくわれるわけではない！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あれ？自分らしくないなぁ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/19/0909563/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まぁでも、頑張るぞー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/19/0909563/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/19/0909563/0016.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"TV の横には、安定の塩とこしょうがおいてありますよー！わら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂ってここ！をみてるかたはわかりますよね？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/19/0909563/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ウサギの形のものがそうですよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その横にはアロマの香りの容器がございますよー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/19/0909563/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"てか、みにゃみさまが、blogの更新を頑張っているではないか"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/19/0909563/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すんばらしーっ感激です"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/19/0909563/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すごいぞみにゃみ！\nまあやもがんばるぞー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/19/0909563/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんは最近頑張ってることはある？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"bye ＼(^o^)／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっ！今日のタイトルは、ブログコメントにまぁやのタイトルを考えてくださったかたがいたので、それを使わせていたただきました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/19/0909563/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/19/0909563/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じゃぁ\nばーーーーいっ★"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/19/0909563/0005.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}